#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Turn a pin on or off ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Ligar ou desligar um pino ( (-o) ou (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Pulse width modulate (PWM) a pin with the given duty cycle (0 - 1023)."
msgstr ""
"Modular por largura de pulso (PWM) um pino com o ciclo de trabalho (duty "
"cycle) dado (0 - 1023)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report number of analog pins on this device."
msgstr "Reportar o número de pinos analógicos deste dispositivo."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report number of digital pins on this device."
msgstr "Reportar o número de pinos digitais deste dispositivo."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the value of a register (0-255) of an I2C device (0-127)."
msgstr "Reportar o valor de um registro (0-255) de um dispositivo I2C (0-127)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Set an I2C device and register to given value (0-255)."
msgstr "Definir dispositivo I2C e registro para um valor dado (0-255)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Receive multiple bytes from an I2C device."
msgstr "Receber múltiplos bytes de um dispositivo I2C."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send multiple bytes to an I2C device."
msgstr "Enviar múltiplos bytes para um dispositivo I2C."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte (0-255) to an SPI device."
msgstr "Enviar um byte (0-255) para um dispositivo SPI."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Read a byte from an SPI device while sending a zero byte. Report the byte received."
msgstr ""
"Ler um byte de um dispositivo SPI enviando um byte zero. Reportar o byte "
"recebido."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Set the SPI clock speed, mode, channel (Raspberry Pi only), and bit order."
msgstr ""
"Definir velocidade de clock do SPI, modo, canal (apenas Raspberry Pi) e "
"ordem dos bits."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte array via SPI, replacing its contents with the bytes received."
msgstr ""
"Enviar um array de bytes via SPI, substituindo seu conteúdo pelos bytes "
"recebidos."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Open the serial port at the given baud rate."
msgstr "Abrir a porta serial com o baud rate informado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Close the serial port."
msgstr "Fechar a porta serial."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report data received from the serial port (a byte array)."
msgstr "Reportar os dados recebidos da porta serial (um array de bytes)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte array to the serial port."
msgstr "Enviar um array de bytes para a porta serial."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte array to the serial port, starting at the given byte."
msgstr "Enviar um array de bytes para a porta serial, iniciando do byte dado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Write a byte to the pin at the specified baud rate."
msgstr ""
"Escrever um byte no pino com a taxa de transmissão (baud rate) especificada."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Run when the board powers up or when the IDE start button is clicked."
msgstr ""
"Rodar quando a placa é ligada ou quando o botão iniciar da IDE é clicado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Run when buttons A, B, or A+B are pressed."
msgstr "Rodar quando os botões A, B ou A+B forem pressionados."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks indefinitely."
msgstr "Repetir os blocos internos indefinidamente."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks the given number of times."
msgstr "Repetir os blocos internos o número determinado de vezes."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Wait the given number of milliseconds."
msgstr "Aguardar o número determinado de milissegundos."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Run the first set of blocks whose test condition is (-o) ."
msgstr "Rodar o primeiro conjunto de blocos cuja condição de teste for (-o) ."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Run when the condition becomes (-o) ."
msgstr "Rodar quando a condição se tornar (-o) ."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Wait until the condition becomes (-o) ."
msgstr "Esperar até que a condição se torne (-o) ."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Return (report) the given value from a function or script."
msgstr "Retornar (reportar) o valor de uma função ou script."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Run when the given message is received as a broadcast."
msgstr "Rodar quando a mensagem for recebida como uma transmissão (broadcast)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Broadcast the given message."
msgstr "Transmitir (broadcast) a mensagem escolhida."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Do nothing. Used to add notes and documentation."
msgstr "Não faz nada. Usado para adicionar notas e documentação."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a list containing the given range of numbers (with optional increment). Useful in \"for\" loops."
msgstr ""
"Reportar uma lista contendo o intervalo de números especificado (com "
"incremento opcional). Útil em loops \"para\"."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks with the variable set to the current iteration number or item."
msgstr ""
"Repetir os blocos internos com a variável definida para o número da iteração "
"ou o item atual."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks until the condition becomes (-o) ."
msgstr "Repetir os blocos internos até que a condição se torne (-o) ."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Stop this task."
msgstr "Parar esta tarefa."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Stop all tasks except this one."
msgstr "Parar todas as tarefas exceto esta."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Wait the given number of microseconds."
msgstr "Aguardar o número determinado de microssegundos."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the last broadcast message received."
msgstr "Reportar a última mensagem recebida (broadcast)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the given argument or defaultValue if the argument was not supplied by the caller."
msgstr ""
"Reportar o argumento passado ou o defaultValue caso nenhum argumento tenha "
"sido fornecido por quem o chamou."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Call the function with the given name and optional parameter list."
msgstr "Chamar a função com o nome dado e a lista opcional de parâmetros."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Call the function with the given name and optional parameter list and report its return value."
msgstr ""
"Chamar a função com o nome e lista de parâmetros opcionais e reportar seu "
"valor de retorno."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the sum of the given numbers."
msgstr "Reportar a soma dos números."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the first number minus the second."
msgstr "Reportar o primeiro número menos o segundo."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the product of the given numbers."
msgstr "Reportar o produto dos números dados."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the first number divided by the second."
msgstr "Reportar o primeiro número dividido pelo segundo."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the remainder of dividing the first number by the second."
msgstr "Reportar o resto da divisão do primeiro número pelo segundo."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the absolute value of the given number (always >= 0)."
msgstr "Reportar o valor absoluto do número informado (sempre >= 0)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the minimum of the values."
msgstr "Reportar o mínimo entre os valores."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the maximum of the values."
msgstr "Reportar o máximo entre os valores."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a randomly chosen number in the given range."
msgstr "Reportar um número escolhido aleatoriamente na faixa informada."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is less than the second one."
msgstr "Reportar (-o) se o primeiro valor for menor que o segundo."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is less than or equal to the second one."
msgstr "Reportar (-o) se o primeiro valor for menor ou igual ao segundo."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the two values are equal."
msgstr "Reportar (-o) se os dois valores forem iguais."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the two values are not equal."
msgstr "Reportar (-o) se os dois valores não forem iguais."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is greater than or equal to the second one."
msgstr "Reportar (-o) se o primeiro valor for maior ou igual ao segundo."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is greater than the second one."
msgstr "Reportar (-o) se o primeiro valor for maior que o segundo."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Boolean constant ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Constante booleana ( (-o) ou (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Report the logical inverse of a Boolean ( (-o) or (o-) ) value."
msgstr "Reportar o inverso lógico de um valor Booleano ( (-o) ou (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if both values are (-o)"
msgstr "Reportar (-o) se ambos os valores forem (-o)"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if either value is (-o)"
msgstr "Reportar (-o) se pelo menos um dos valores for (-o)"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if first input is a value of the given data type."
msgstr ""
"Reportar (-o) se a primeira entrada for um valor do tipo de dado fornecido."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Convert a value to the given data type."
msgstr "Converter um valor para o tipo de dado informado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "If the condition is (-o) report the first alternative otherwise report the second alternative."
msgstr ""
"Se a condição for (-o) reportar a primeira alternativa, caso contrário "
"reportar a segunda alternativa."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Map a value in the \"from\" range to the corresponding value in the \"to\" range."
msgstr ""
"Mapear um valor na faixa \"de\" para o valor correspondente na faixa "
"\"para\"."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the numerical value of a hexadecimal string (range: -0x1FFFFFFF to 0x1FFFFFFF)"
msgstr ""
"Reportar o valor numérico de uma string hexadecimal (intervalo: -0x1FFFFFFF "
"a 0x1FFFFFFF)"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise AND of two numbers."
msgstr "Reportar o AND bit a bit (bitwise AND) de dois números."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise OR of two numbers."
msgstr "Reportar o OR bit a bit (bitwise OR) de dois números."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise XOR (exclusive OR) of two numbers."
msgstr "Reportar o XOR (OR exclusivo) bit a bit de dois números."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise inverse of the given number."
msgstr "Reportar o inverso bit a bit do número dado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the given number shifted left by the given number of bits."
msgstr ""
"Reportar o número dado deslocado para a esquerda pela quantidade de bits "
"dada."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the given number shifted right by the given number of bits (arithmetic shift; sign is maintained)."
msgstr ""
"Reportar o número dado deslocado para a direita pela quantidade de bits dada "
"(deslocamento aritmético; o sinal é mantido)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Set a variable to the given value."
msgstr "Definir uma variável para o valor dado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Change a variable by the given amount."
msgstr "Mudar uma variável no valor indicado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Create a variable local to the containing script with the given initial value."
msgstr "Criar uma variável local ao script contêiner com o valor inicial dado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the Nth item of a list, string, or byte array."
msgstr "Reportar o item N de uma lista, string ou array de bytes."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the number of items in a list, string, or byte array."
msgstr "Reportar o número de itens em uma lista, string ou array de bytes."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Join (concatenate) the given lists, strings, or byte arrays and report the result."
msgstr ""
"Juntar (concatenar) as listas, strings ou arrays de bytes informados e "
"reportar o resultado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Create and report a short list containing the given items. Length limited by available stack space."
msgstr ""
"Criar e reportar uma lista curta contendo os itens dados. O tamanho é "
"limitado pelo espaço da pilha disponível."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Add an item to the end of a list."
msgstr "Adicionar um item ao final de uma lista."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Replace the Nth item (or all items) of a list or byte array with the given value."
msgstr ""
"Substituir o item N (ou todos os itens) de uma lista ou array de bytes pelo "
"valor dado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Delete the Nth item (or all items) of a list."
msgstr "Apagar o item N (ou todos os itens) de uma lista."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Find and report the index of an item in a list or a substring within a string. Report -1 if not found."
msgstr ""
"Procurar e reportar o índice de um item numa lista ou substring dentro de "
"uma string. Reporta -1 se não encontrar."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a copy from the given index through the end (or optional stop index) of the given list, string, or byte array."
msgstr ""
"Reportar uma cópia partindo do índice inicial até o fim (ou um índice de "
"parada opcional) da lista, string ou array de bytes fornecido."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Split the given string with the given delimiter and report the result (a list of strings)."
msgstr ""
"Dividir a string fornecida usando o delimitador escolhido e reportar o "
"resultado (uma lista de strings)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Combine the items of a list into a string, optionally separated by a delimiter (e.g. comma)."
msgstr ""
"Combinar os itens de uma lista em uma string, separada opcionalmente por um "
"delimitador (ex. vírgula)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the Unicode value (\"code point\") of the Nth character of the given string."
msgstr ""
"Reportar o valor Unicode (\"code point\") do enésimo caractere da string "
"fornecida."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a string containing the given Unicode value (\"code point\") or list of values."
msgstr ""
"Reportar uma string contendo o valor Unicode (\"code point\") ou lista de "
"valores fornecida."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a new list of the given length filled with zero or the optional value."
msgstr ""
"Reportar uma nova lista do tamanho especificado preenchida com zero ou um "
"valor opcional."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a new byte array of the given length filled with zero or the optional value."
msgstr ""
"Reportar um novo array de bytes do tamanho especificado preenchido com zero "
"ou o valor opcional."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a byte array containing the UTF-8 bytes of the given string."
msgstr "Reportar um array de bytes contendo os bytes UTF-8 da string informada."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the number of words of memory available. Stop button frees up memory."
msgstr ""
"Reportar o número de palavras (words) da memória disponíveis. O botão Parar "
"libera memória."

